ss=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_50\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वमिदं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्वम् इदम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_51\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_52\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">भवती</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_53\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">त्येतद्व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_54\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चतुरित्यादिपद्यद्वयेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">चतुः इति-आदि-पद्य-द्वयेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_55\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_56\" data-g=\"anubhuti2\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_57\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">शास्त्रमित्यस्योपसद्येत्यनेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">शास्त्रम् इति अस्य उपसद्य इति अनेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_58\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">सम्बन्धः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_59\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_60\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतमङ्गिरसम्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतम् अङ्गिरसम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_61\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_62\">२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.3:tanubhuti_0_63\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"2\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।३–४ · मु १।१।४–५</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_0\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एकस्मिन्विदिते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एकस्मिन् विदिते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_1\" data-flag data-g=\"anubhuti\">सर्व</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_2\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञातमिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञातम् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_3\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">वैदिकी</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_5\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रसिद्धिरस्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रसिद्धिः अस्ति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_6\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तद्वस्तु</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्-वस्तु</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_7\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">किं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">किम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_8\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्यान्निश्चित्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्यात् निश्चित्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_9\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">मे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_10\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">वद</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_12\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_13\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_14\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वैदिकीति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वैदिकी इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_15\">।</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_16\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">येनाश्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">येन अश्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_17\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">श्रुतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">श्रुतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_18\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भवत्यमतं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भवति अमतम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_19\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">मतमविज्ञातंविज्ञात</span> \" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_20\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">मिति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_21\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">श्रुतिः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_22\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_23\">३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_24\">॥</span></span> </div></details> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_25\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">शृणु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_26\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">विद्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_27\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">उभे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_28\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तावद्वेदितव्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तावत् वेदितव्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_29\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">परापरे</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परा-अपरे</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_30\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_31\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पृष्टं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पृष्टम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_32\" data-g=\"anubhuti\">वस्तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:1.1.5:tanubhuti_0_33\" data-g=\"anubhuti\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तयोर्मध्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तयोः मध्ये</span></span> <span class=\"